 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Present the experience",
   "texto": [
    "**Erfaring** is practical experience; **utdanning** is training or studies. A **CV** summarizes studies, jobs and skills. **Søke en stilling** means applying for a job."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Two uses of «som»",
   "texto": [
    "You know **som** with professions: **Jeg jobber som resepsjonist** («work as a receptionist»). It also introduces a description: **en leder som hjelper meg** («a boss who helps me.»). Here **som** is equivalent to «that / who» and refers to the person or thing before."
   ]
  },
